<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang='en-US'><head><meta content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" http-equiv="Content-Type"/><script>window['ec:pageId']='1088320570078559568'</script><title>CFP</title><link href="/images/favicon.ico" rel="icon" type="image/jpeg"/><link href="/css/cool.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/cfp/classic.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<link href="/css/menu_cfp.css?version=545" rel="StyleSheet" type="text/css"/>
<script src="/js/easy.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/menu.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/form.js?version=545"></script><script src="/js/inplace.js?version=545"></script><script>EC.version='545'</script></head>
<body><table class="page" id="page"><tr style="height:1px"><td><table class="header"><tr><td class="logocell"><a href="/" title="EasyChair home page"><img class="leftlogo" src="/images/logoEC_short.png"/></a></td><td class="rolecell">EasyChair Smart CFP</td><td style="width: 99%"></td><td class="helplink"><a class="toplinks" href="/docs/home" title="User guide">User guide</a></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr style="height:99%"><td class="menu_and_content"><div class="menu" id="menu0"><table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" class="menu" style="position:static; visibility:visible"><tr><td class="top" id="menu1" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu1','/cfp',{&quot;a&quot;:null})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu1')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu1')" title="Main page">Home</td><td class="top" id="menu2" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu2','/cfp/choose',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu2')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu2')" title="Create a new CFP">New CFP</td><td class="top" id="menu3" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu3','/cfp/all',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu3')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu3')" title="Manage my CFPs">My CFPs</td><td class="top" id="menu4" onclick="Menu.followLink2('menu4','/cfp/watchlist',{})" onmouseout="Menu.hide('menu4')" onmouseover="Menu.show('menu4')" title="My CFP watchlist">Watchlist</td></tr></table></div><div class="search_row" id="cfp:search:row"><form action="/cfp/search" id="search-form"><input id="search-input" name="query" placeholder="Search" type="text"/></form></div><div class="summary"><div class="pagetitle">CFP</div></div><div class="content" id="content"><div class="subcontent"><div id="cfp" style="clear:right"><table class="title_table"><tr><td class="single"><div id="cfptitle">HMDS 2027: 2nd International Symposium on Heterogeneous and Multi-Domain Systems</div><div id="cfpvenue">Tokyo Metropolitan University, Minami-Osawa Campus</div><div id="cfpdateplace">Tokyo, Japan, March 30-April 2, 2027</div></td></tr></table><table class="date_table"><tr><td>Conference web page</td><td><a href="https://hmds2027.org/" target="_blank">https://hmds2027.org/</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission link</td><td><a href="https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=hmds2027" target="_blank">https://easychair.org/conferences/?conf=hmds2027</a></td></tr><tr><td>Submission deadline</td><td>November 15, 2026</td></tr></table><div class="topics">Topics: <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=15457825" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_fuchsia bg_bluelight">robotics and autonomous systems</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=154661" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_bluelight bg_aqua">cyber physical systems</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=36396" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_blue bg_bluelight">modeling and simulation</span></a> <a href="/cfp/topic?tid=36570889" onclick="return EC.linkClick(event)"><span class="tag fg_fuchsia bg_bluelight">system integration and control</span></a></div><p><strong>HMDS 2027</strong> brings together theory, simulation, experiments, and applications for systems that interact across multiple engineering and computational domains.</p><h2>Submission Guidelines</h2><p>Authors are invited to submit a two-page abstract and may indicate a preference for oral or poster presentation. Abstract submission opens on <strong>July 1, 2026</strong> and closes on <strong>November 15, 2026</strong>. Decisions will be communicated before December 15, 2026.</p><p>Authors selected for oral presentation will be invited to submit a full paper by <strong>January 31, 2027</strong>. Details and templates are available at <a href="https://hmds2027.org/authors.html">hmds2027.org/authors</a>.</p><h2>Topics</h2><ul><li>System integration, interoperability, distributed control, coordination, and sensor fusion</li><li>Robotics, autonomous and cyber-physical systems, IoT, AI, and digital twins</li><li>Modeling, simulation, human-machine interfaces, energy, biomedical systems, aerospace engineering and space systems, and engineering education</li></ul><h2>Publication</h2><p>Selected peer-reviewed full papers will be published in Springer's <em>Mechanisms and Machine Science</em> series. The series is indexed in <strong>Scopus</strong> and <strong>Ei-Compendex</strong>; chapters receive a DOI and the volume receives an ISBN. Publication is free of charge for authors. Papers must be at least 6 pages; 8-10 pages are recommended.</p><h2>Venue</h2><p>Tokyo Metropolitan University, Minami-Osawa Campus, Tokyo, Japan. The symposium will take place from <strong>March 30 to April 2, 2027</strong>.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions may be sent to Dr. Sajjad Keshtkar at <a href="mailto:s.keshtkar@tmu.ac.jp">s.keshtkar@tmu.ac.jp</a>. Official website: <a href="https://hmds2027.org/">hmds2027.org</a>.</p><h2>Host and Supporting Organizations</h2><p>Hosted by Tokyo Metropolitan University with support from IFToMM communities and Jc-IFToMM.</p></div></div></div></td></tr><tr><td class="footer">Copyright © 2002 – 2026 EasyChair</td></tr></table></body></html>
